# DrumMania 10th Mix and GuitarFreaks 11th Mix in session (with gtfrk11m-session, run alongside:
# two processes on one session cable, runtime/sys573/link.h). This side hosts the multi-session
# unit. From what drmn10m-boot left: two coins and Start at the title; the WELCOME screen opens
# the joining period, the GuitarFreaks cabinet joins (PLAYER 1 ENTRY), then both pass CAUTION,
# the mode select (STANDARD) and the music select, and play the first stage of 花火 together,
# its music from the unit's MP3 decoder.
game drmn10m

at 9000 press "Coin 1" 8
at 9040 press "Coin 1" 8
from 9200 every 300 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 8400 every 300 snap
at 16800 quit
